#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:5 30dcd749469347bc8c12b7600f84ea73
msgid "APSync"
msgstr "APSync"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:9 fc95160415da43a08bf0fc954c16abcf
msgid ""
"APSync is deprecated.  Instead we recommend using `BlueOS "
"<https://blueos.cloud/>`__ or `Rpanion-server "
"<https://www.docs.rpanion.com/software/rpanion-server>`__"
msgstr ""
"APSync 已弃用。建议改用 `BlueOS <https://blueos.cloud/>`__ 或 `Rpanion-server "
"<https://www.docs.rpanion.com/software/rpanion-server>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:11 c0d67c1c29404731837b2c8f984412b0
msgid ""
"APSync simplifies the setup of companion computers so that they can be used "
"to provide additional functionality to ArduPilot and also to ease "
"integration with internet services."
msgstr "APSync 简化了伴飞计算机的配置，使其可为 ArduPilot 提供额外功能，并简化与互联网服务的集成。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:13 c8a4d47b75274a148cb5dcfe47705a4a
msgid ""
"The current release automatically creates a Wifi Access Point on startup, "
"allows DataFlash logging to the companion computer and \"simple\" real-time "
"video streaming from a camera on the drone to the ground station."
msgstr ""
"当前版本在启动时自动创建 WiFi 接入点，支持 DataFlash 日志写入伴飞计算机，以及将无人机摄像头的 「简单」 实时视频流传输到地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:15 aa484ea8e22c4d08b679d4ff747758bf
msgid ""
"The supported companion computers are the :ref:`RPi3 <raspberry-pi-via-"
"mavlink>`, :ref:`NVidia TX1 <companion-computer-nvidia-tx1>`, :ref:`NVidia "
"TX2 <companion-computer-nvidia-tx2>` and :ref:`Intel Edison <intel-edison>`."
msgstr ""
"支持的伴飞计算机包括 :ref:`RPi3 <raspberry-pi-via-mavlink>`、:ref:`NVidia TX1 "
"<companion-computer-nvidia-tx1>`、:ref:`NVidia TX2 <companion-computer-"
"nvidia-tx2>` 和 :ref:`Intel Edison <intel-edison>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:19 d0a6557516874dd384e44a89be965622
msgid "Video streaming from the Intel Edison is not supported."
msgstr "不支持从 Intel Edison 进行视频流传输。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:21 f7d9d7948b4247cb805c858bf2908e42
msgid ""
":ref:`Installation instructions <apsync-intro-installing-apsync>` are at the"
" bottom of this page."
msgstr ":ref:`安装说明 <apsync-intro-installing-apsync>` 在本页底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:26 1b9ca1073eb34c75acd4babec831e86a
msgid ""
"Please get involved by reporting issues in the `ArduPilot Forums "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/development-team>`__.  Developers can help "
"improve APSync by submitting PRs to `ArduPilot/companion "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/companion>`__ and/or discuss with others "
"developers in the companion computers channel of the `ArduPilot Discord Chat"
" <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__!"
msgstr ""
"请通过在 `ArduPilot 论坛 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/development-team>`__ "
"报告问题来参与贡献。开发者可以通过向 `ArduPilot/companion "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/companion>`__ 提交 PR，以及/或在 `ArduPilot Discord "
"聊天 <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ 的伴飞计算机频道与其他开发者讨论来帮助改进 APSync！"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:29 b1735f3872394e91853763e712f03367
msgid "Wifi Access Point & DataFlash logging"
msgstr "WiFi 接入点与 DataFlash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:34 9abe085a8a7248b2a25108af51b2a081
msgid ""
"On start-up an access point is created with name \"ardupilot\".  The default"
" password is also \"ardupilot\"."
msgstr "启动时会创建名为 「ardupilot」 的接入点。默认密码也是 「ardupilot」。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:36 a6e9dc8e48b840fe9cf56a93b0cd7939
msgid ""
"The user can connect to this access point and then easily connect to "
"ArduPilot running on the autopilot by setting their ground station "
"(including Mission Planner) to connect using \"UDP\", port 14550."
msgstr ""
"用户连接到该接入点后，可将地面站（包括 Mission Planner）设置为通过 「UDP」 端口 14550 连接，从而轻松连接到运行在飞控上的 "
"ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:42 31f77134d56d4cbeb3d370d01e3c3e0b
msgid ""
"Once connected to the WiFi network is possible to connect to these two URLs:"
msgstr "连接到 WiFi 网络后，可访问以下两个 URL："

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:44 e4ce5e1238b149bbb7d8c3806c9eaa76
msgid ""
"Dataflash logs are streamed to the companion computer via MAVLink and stored"
" on the companion computer's filesystem (as well as on the pixhawk's "
"dataflash). Dataflash log files can then be quickly downloaded (over wifi) "
"using a script (Windows users may use `apsync-download-logs "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/apsync-download-logs-"
"latest.zip>`__) or you may pull the SD card out of the companion computer."
msgstr ""
"DataFlash 日志通过 MAVLink 流式传输到伴飞计算机，并存储在伴飞计算机的文件系统上（同时也存储在 Pixhawk 的 DataFlash"
" 中）。然后可以使用脚本通过 WiFi 快速下载 DataFlash 日志文件（Windows 用户可使用 `apsync-download-logs "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/apsync-download-logs-"
"latest.zip>`__），也可以直接取出伴飞计算机的 SD 卡。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:48 de67fe85ac644ca585046519aae6e3f6
msgid "Simple Configuration Web page"
msgstr "简易配置网页"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:53 9ec45548e5ee436a8ac246457ee79156
msgid ""
"A light weight webserver runs on the companion computer which allows the "
"user to connect to the drone using a known URL (``http://10.0.1.128`` or "
"``http://10.0.1.128:8000``) and do the following:"
msgstr ""
"伴飞计算机上运行一个轻量级 Web 服务器，用户可通过已知 URL（``http://10.0.1.128`` 或 "
"``http://10.0.1.128:8000``）连接到无人机并执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:55 86f34561c636406399e61264207112de
msgid "View and modify parameters"
msgstr "查看和修改参数"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:56 52f0f6ecb11b4bac83f7b801c9b9216c
msgid "View sensor information and trigger some calibrations"
msgstr "查看传感器信息并触发某些校准"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:57 320f2eea1f914cf6a3bb1f75c951aaab
msgid "Modify the Wifi access point name and password"
msgstr "修改 WiFi 接入点名称和密码"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:58 e99c4b48e22248658945c4aca5ae9a13
msgid ""
"View and download log files if they are stored on the companion computer"
msgstr "如果日志文件存储在伴飞计算机上，则可查看和下载"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:61 84d34fb980d74c239499b03c7da7c23f
msgid "Simple Video"
msgstr "简单视频"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:67 2f74d78ef41345a69938207779957f73
msgid ""
"A single video stream is sent to the IP address of the first ground station "
"that requests telemetry data."
msgstr "单路视频流将发送至首个请求数传数据的地面站的 IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:72 2458f5be76674ff3bd27edf77c1b537c
msgid "Installing APSync"
msgstr "安装 APSync"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:74 fb9b717ac66c4b35842ae6e0dd34892d
msgid ""
"Images for the supported boards can be found in `firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync>`__."
msgstr ""
"支持的飞控板镜像可在 `firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync>`__ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:76 3eb28e5066d04dcea2cc77a2e8a7eba6
msgid ""
"Please follow the instructions for installing these images on the wiki page "
"for each board (:ref:`RPi3 <raspberry-pi-via-mavlink>`, :ref:`NVidia TX1 "
"<companion-computer-nvidia-tx1>` and :ref:`Intel Edison <intel-edison>`)."
msgstr ""
"请按照各飞控板 wiki 页面上的说明安装这些镜像（:ref:`RPi3 <raspberry-pi-via-"
"mavlink>`、:ref:`NVidia TX1 <companion-computer-nvidia-tx1>` 和 :ref:`Intel "
"Edison <intel-edison>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:78 b2e3eabe6bfb4c3386a2f7e222317abd
msgid ""
"The flight controller (i.e. Pixhawk or similar) should be configured to "
"communicate with the companion computer by setting the following parameters "
"and then reboot the board:"
msgstr "飞控（如 Pixhawk 或类似飞控）应通过设置以下参数与伴飞计算机通信，然后重启飞控板："

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:80 2e6fae6366554f34a9bb1443affb59e9
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <copter:SERIAL2_BAUD>` 921 (for RPi3, TX1 and Edison) or "
"1500 (for TX2)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <copter:SERIAL2_BAUD>` 921（适用于 RPi3、TX1 和 Edison）或 "
"1500（适用于 TX2）"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:81 88ee56b88cbf47f19df4c791bbea2d88
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <copter:SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 2"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <copter:SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 2"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:82 9f3176f3ee6d4cde90d0de9c3ab2abbe
msgid ":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE <copter:LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` 3"
msgstr ":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE <copter:LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` 3"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:85 74431392ce0643e8adf44dd7a8e9997d
msgid "Connecting with SSH"
msgstr "通过 SSH 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:87 2b312afb1e0e4d5d8c46f75e126d3d71
msgid ""
"You can connect to the companion computer with a terminal emulator such as "
"`Putty <https://www.putty.org/>`__ by connecting to the board's wifi access "
"point and then ssh to 10.0.1.128 username: apsync, password: apsync"
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 `Putty <https://www.putty.org/>`__ 等终端模拟器连接至飞控板的 WiFi 接入点，然后 SSH 到 "
"10.0.1.128，用户名：apsync，密码：apsync"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:90 fe18633f7cd84023a57c6881991ce8bd
msgid "How flight controller data is routed to various programs"
msgstr "飞控数据如何路由到各程序"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:92 00fb9c45583440dfa4c0f4cc2209de9e
msgid ""
"By default APsync uses \"mavlink-router\" to allow multiple programs running"
" on the companion computer to talk to the flight controller.  This programs "
"configuration is held in ~/start_mavlink-router/mavlink-router.conf and "
"defines the following connections:"
msgstr ""
"APSync 默认使用 「mavlink-router」 允许伴飞计算机上运行的多个程序与飞控通信。该程序的配置保存在 ~/start_mavlink-"
"router/mavlink-router.conf 中，定义了以下连接："

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:94 52e0d140767f4e6c9d51cd156303584d
msgid ""
"/dev/ttyTHS1 at baud 1500000 to communicate with the flight controller (on "
"TX1/TX2)"
msgstr "/dev/ttyTHS1，波特率 1500000，用于与飞控通信（TX1/TX2 上）"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:95 f44b2b53e502451b99fabe1e92715c7b
msgid "UDP 127.0.0.1:14655 for MavProxy running on the companion computer"
msgstr "UDP 127.0.0.1:14655，供伴飞计算机上运行的 MavProxy 使用"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:96 7763037214244faa89e7b7218b2b930e
msgid ""
"UDP 127.0.0.1:14556 for dflogger (writes dataflash logs to companion "
"computer)"
msgstr "UDP 127.0.0.1:14556，供 dflogger 使用（将 DataFlash 日志写入伴飞计算机）"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:97 62a2c3a7220c4b80a6d8f67793bb0694
msgid "UDP 127.0.0.1:14755 for APweb (small configuration web service)"
msgstr "UDP 127.0.0.1:14755，供 APweb 使用（轻量配置 Web 服务）"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:98 91e66ac4ff3e45588c14656ab7d04fc6
msgid ""
"UDP 127.0.0.1:14765 for OpenKai (vision processing program, similar to ROS)"
msgstr "UDP 127.0.0.1:14765，供 OpenKai 使用（视觉处理程序，类似于 ROS）"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:99 f281a17269ef45789cb47e3b3a813091
msgid "UDP 10.0.1.255:14765 for telemetry to Ground Station via wifi"
msgstr "UDP 10.0.1.255:14765，通过 WiFi 向地面站发送数传数据"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:101 2b20102072e94848ac5ce95fb16474e5
msgid ""
"If additional programs are run on the companion computer that also need data"
" from the flight controller, new ports can be opened by adding new lines at "
"the bottom of ~/start_mavlink-router/mavlink-router.conf and then reboot the"
" board."
msgstr ""
"如果伴飞计算机上运行的其他程序也需要飞控数据，可在 ~/start_mavlink-router/mavlink-router.conf "
"底部添加新行以开放新端口，然后重启飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:103 7054105161c8454f9e53d2fe8b848f65
msgid ""
"For example the following lines could be added to open up port 14855 for use"
" by ROS running locally on the companion computer:"
msgstr "例如，可添加以下行以开放端口 14855，供本地运行在伴飞计算机上的 ROS 使用："
